// Ordered to roughly follow NG_PARSER.md detector list
Test 0012
Expect tag positive-integer

Test 10.4kg
Expect tag decimal-number

Test 10:10 start
Expect tag time-value

Test 2026-01-01
Expect tag datetime

Test 2026-01-01T08:00:00
Expect tag datetime

Test /10s rest
Expect tag recovery-time

// Composite token with children
Test 2:50/100m
Expect tag speed
Expect child 0 tag time-value
Expect child 0 string 2:50
Expect child 1 tag keyword
Expect child 1 string /
Expect child 2 tag distance
Expect child 2 string 100m

Test 10x squat
Expect tag positive-integer

Test 100kg bench
Expect tag weight
Expect child 0 tag positive-integer
Expect child 0 string 100
Expect child 1 tag keyword
Expect child 1 string kg

Test 100m run
Expect tag distance

Test 10-50 reps
Expect tag num-range

Test 2-3x15-20@bw
Expect tag set-rep-range-load

Test 2-3x15-20x50kg
Expect tag set-rep-range-load

Test 100-200m target
Expect tag distance-range

Test 100m-200m target
Expect tag distance-range

Test 3AM wake
Expect tag positive-integer

Test > note
Expect tag details-data

Test # Morning Run\nnext
Expect tag heading-data

Test 120bpm zone2
Expect tag bpm
Expect child 0 tag positive-integer
Expect child 0 string 120
Expect child 1 tag keyword
Expect child 1 string bpm

Test 120kcal
Expect tag kcal
Expect child 0 tag positive-integer
Expect child 0 string 120
Expect child 1 tag keyword
Expect child 1 string kcal

Test 70% load
Expect tag percentage

Test Swim 100m
Expect tag exercise
Expect child 0 tag exercise-name
Expect child 0 string Swim
Expect child 1 tag distance
Expect child 1 string 100m

Test Swim 2:50/100m
Expect tag exercise
Expect child 0 tag exercise-name
Expect child 0 string Swim
Expect child 1 tag speed
Expect child 1 string 2:50/100m

Test 40-50%
Expect tag percentage-range
Expect child 0 tag num-range
Expect child 0 string 40-50
Expect child 1 tag keyword
Expect child 1 string %

Test 40%-40%
Expect tag percentage-range

Test 1RM test
Expect tag rm
Expect child 0 tag positive-integer
Expect child 0 string 1
Expect child 1 tag keyword
Expect child 1 string RM

Test 5RM test
Expect tag rm
Expect child 0 tag positive-integer
Expect child 0 string 5
Expect child 1 tag keyword
Expect child 1 string RM

Test Zone1 easy
Expect tag zone

Test Zone2 easy
Expect tag zone

Test I easy
Expect tag zone-roman

Test II easy
Expect tag zone-roman

Test III easy
Expect tag zone-roman

Test IV easy
Expect tag zone-roman

Test V easy
Expect tag zone-roman

Test 2026-05-09\n2026-05-10
Expect tag datetime

Test 2026-05-09T14:30+02:00
Expect tag datetime
